It's fine. Don't worry about it.

01:48:34.310 --> 01:48:37.900
Oh, right. Waltz-<i>san</i> was on TV.

01:48:37.900 --> 01:48:44.680
Apparently the sniping spree brought to light all of the crimes he committed in his past.

01:48:44.680 --> 01:48:48.040
He'll be spending the rest of his days in prison.

01:48:48.040 --> 01:48:53.170
It turns out that the pair behind the snipings were victims of his, just trying to get revenge.

01:48:53.170 --> 01:48:54.590
Even so, Ran...

01:48:54.590 --> 01:48:58.700
I can't believe you took on that man with a machine gun!

01:48:58.700 --> 01:49:00.430
I was just in a trance...

01:49:00.430 --> 01:49:03.680
Really, I'm glad that you got off with just a few scratches!

01:49:03.680 --> 01:49:07.620
What if a bullet'd gone through your heart?! I can't help but worry...

01:49:07.620 --> 01:49:10.500
Well, you know I've got good luck...

01:49:10.500 --> 01:49:12.190
It'll be fine!

01:49:12.690 --> 01:49:17.440
There's only one man who can snipe Ran-<i>kun</i>'s heart!

01:49:21.090 --> 01:49:24.240
Right, her beloved Shin'ichi-<i>kun</i>!

01:49:24.240 --> 01:49:26.990
Oh, Sonoko...

01:49:25.460 --> 01:49:26.990
For now, anyway... {FORESHADOWING ZOMG}

01:49:29.500 --> 01:49:31.700
Are you okay, Conan-<i>kun</i>?

01:49:31.700 --> 01:49:34.020
You better not be trying to get out of this.

01:49:34.020 --> 01:49:38.270
You're going to make up for all the work you left us to do!

01:49:38.270 --> 01:49:40.060
Okay, let's go to the pool!

01:49:40.060 --> 01:49:40.580
Sure!

01:49:40.580 --> 01:49:44.600
Sorry about leaving you behind, Haibara-<i>san</i>,
but thanks for agreeing to watch Conan-<i>kun</i>!

01:49:44.600 --> 01:49:45.500
Sure.

01:49:45.500 --> 01:49:47.510
Your hands aren't moving.

01:49:47.510 --> 01:49:51.940
Don't tell me they expect me to finish this all by myself?!

